// assets/worldgen/resources.ron
//
// Resource placement config for Stage 3.5.
//
// Rarity is the target fraction of eligible tiles before the Advanced
// resource_abundance multiplier. Each tile can hold at most one resource.
// Terrain filters are OR-combined; biome filters restrict land resources.
//
// latitude_preference uses normalized absolute latitude:
//   0.0 = equator, 1.0 = poles.
